@code{m0} is an implementation of a flexible macro
processor.

This is release @value{VERSION}.  Almost everything should work as described, but it is still considered experimental.
This means that the functions, instructions and options and how they operate are not yet in a final state.
Although effort is made to keep newer versions compatible with older macro code, this can not be guaranteed.

